## 3. PROPOSED TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE

To ensure high performance, top-tier security for sensitive medical data, and instant accessibility without app store download barriers:

* **Frontend Apps (Patient & Practitioner):** Built with **Next.js (React)** styled with Tailwind CSS, delivered as an installable **Progressive Web App (PWA)**. Works smoothly across iOS and Android smartphones without requiring immediate App Store submissions or large downloads.
* **Backend API & Workflows:** **Node.js (NestJS)** deployed on high-availability cloud infrastructure to manage secure role-based access control, appointment status state machines, and real-time alerts.
* **Database & Encrypted Storage:** **PostgreSQL** relational database for patient accounts, practitioner registries, and visit ledgers, with encrypted clinical notes and file storage.
* **Communications & Alerts:** Automated SMS and WhatsApp notifications (via Termii API) keeping patients and practitioners updated at every milestone.

